t-sm font-black text-sky-900" data-lab-step-current="true">المهمة 1 من 5</span></div><div data-sm-story="true"><section class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/80 border-2 !border-amber-200" data-lab-fold="story-modeller.story" data-open="true"><header class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5"><h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-700">القصة</h4><button type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" data-deco="true" class="shrink-0 rounded-xl focus:outline-none h-10 w-14"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 80" width="100%" height="100%"><style>.sm-wave{animation:sm-wave .5s ease-in-out 3;transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:left center}@keyframes sm-wave{0%,100%{transform:skewY(0)}50%{transform:skewY(-14deg) scaleX(.92)}}.sm-glow{animation:sm-glow 1.2s ease-out 1}@keyframes sm-glow{0%{opacity:.2}40%{opacity:1}100%{opacity:.35}}.sm-bob{animation:sm-bob .6s ease-in-out 3;transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:bottom center}@keyframes sm-bob{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(4deg)}}@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.sm-wave,.sm-glow,.sm-bob{animation:none}}</style><g><rect x="8" y="62" width="104" height="8" rx="3" fill="#FDE68A"></rect><g><line x1="30" y1="34" x2="30" y2="62" stroke="#94A3B8" stroke-width="1"></line><ellipse cx="30" cy="22" rx="10" ry="13" fill="#F472B6"></ellipse></g><g><line x1="60" y1="34" x2="60" y2="62" stroke="#94A3B8" stroke-width="1"></line><ellipse cx="60" cy="22" rx="10" ry="13" fill="#60A5FA"></ellipse></g><g><line x1="90" y1="34" x2="90" y2="62" stroke="#94A3B8" stroke-width="1"></line><ellipse cx="90" cy="22" rx="10" ry="13" fill="#34D399"></ellipse></g></g></svg></button><button type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls=":R1tp:" data-lab-fold-toggle="true" class="ms-auto inline-flex min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-lg px-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-500"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye-off" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.88 9.88a3 3 0 1 0 4.24 4.24"></path><path d="M10.73 5.08A10.43 10.43 0 0 1 12 5c7 0 10 7 10 7a13.16 13.16 0 0 1-1.67 2.68"></path><path d="M6.61 6.61A13.526 13.526 0 0 0 2 12s3 7 10 7a9.74 9.74 0 0 0 5.39-1.61"></path><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="2" y2="22"></line></svg><span>إخفاء</span></button></header><div id=":R1tp:" class="px-3 pb-3"><p class="leading-snug text-slate-800 text-sm"><span>بمناسبة الاحتفال بالمولد النبوي الشريف، نظمت بلدية حفل استقبال لفائدة التلاميذ النجباء للمؤسسات التعليمية التابعة لها، حضره ممثلون عن قطاع التربية وبعض الأولياء. بهذه المناسبة، اقتنت البلدية 150 علبة عصير برتقال و 150 قطعة حلوى متماثلة ودفعت 11 ⁦250 DA⁩ لكل المصاريف. في نهاية الحفل، بقيت 24 علبة عصير و30 قطعة حلوى ثمنها معا 2 ⁦100 DA⁩. ما هو سعر علبة عصير وسعر قطعة حلوى؟</span></p></div></section></div><div class="space-y-2" data-sm-core="true"><div class="space-y-1 rounded-2xl border-2 border-amber-200 bg-amber-50/60 p-1.5"><p class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-900 block">الحرفان</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-stretch gap-1.5" role="group" aria-label="الحرفان"><button type="button" aria-label="الحرف x: احمله إلى ما يسأل عنه النص" data-drag-source="unk:x" aria-pressed="false" style="touch-action:none;cursor:grab;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;border-color:#2563EB;color:#2563EB;opacity:1" class="sa-manip-object select-none touch-none transition-transform duration-150 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-500    min-h-[44px] min-w-[48px] rounded-xl border-2 bg-white px-2 font-mono text-xl font-black shadow-sm"><span dir="ltr">x</span></button><button type="button" aria-label="الحرف y: احمله إلى ما يسأل عنه النص" data-drag-source="unk:y" aria-pressed="false" style="touch-action:none;cursor:grab;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none;border-color:#E11D48;color:#E11D48;opacity:1" class="sa-manip-object select-none touch-none transition-transform duration-150 focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-blue-500    min-h-[44px] min-w-[48px] rounded-xl border-2 bg-white px-2 font-mono text-xl font-black shadow-sm"><span dir="ltr">y</span></button></div><p class="text-[11px] leading-tight text-slate-600 block">اسحب حرفًا إلى عنصر من القصة، أو المسه ثم المس العنصر.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1" aria-label="ما تتحدّث عنه القصة" role="group"><div role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="150 علبة عصير" data-drop-zone="known:c0" data-drop-owner=":R0:" data-sm-noun="known:c0" class="relative rounded-2xl border-2 transition-colors min-h-[44px] border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-white/70  "><div class="flex h-full items-center justify-center p-1 text-center leading-tight text-slate-700 text-sm"><span><bdi dir="ltr" class="font-mono font-bold">150</bdi> <!-- -->علبة عصير</span></div></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="سعر علبة العصير: ضع هنا حرفًا" data-drop-zone="noun:x" data-drop-owner=":R0:" data-sm-noun="x" class="relative rounded-2xl border-2 transition-colors min-h-[44px] border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-white/70  "><div class="flex h-full flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-0.5 p-1 text-center"><span class="font-bold leading-tight text-slate-800 text-sm">سعر علبة العصير</span></div></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="150 قطعة حلوى" data-drop-zone="known:c1" data-drop-owner=":R0:" data-sm-noun="known:c1" class="relative rounded-2xl border-2 transition-colors min-h-[44px] border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-white/70  "><div class="flex h-full items-center justify-center p-1 text-center leading-tight text-slate-700 text-sm"><span><bdi dir="ltr" class="font-mono font-bold">150</bdi> <!-- -->قطعة حلوى</span></div></div><div role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="11250 DA لكل المصاريف" data-drop-zone="known:c2" d