button type="button" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true" data-deco="true" class="shrink-0 rounded-xl focus:outline-none h-10 w-14"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 80" width="100%" height="100%"><style>.sm-wave{animation:sm-wave .5s ease-in-out 3;transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:left center}@keyframes sm-wave{0%,100%{transform:skewY(0)}50%{transform:skewY(-14deg) scaleX(.92)}}.sm-glow{animation:sm-glow 1.2s ease-out 1}@keyframes sm-glow{0%{opacity:.2}40%{opacity:1}100%{opacity:.35}}.sm-bob{animation:sm-bob .6s ease-in-out 3;transform-box:fill-box;transform-origin:bottom center}@keyframes sm-bob{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-7px) rotate(4deg)}}@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.sm-wave,.sm-glow,.sm-bob{animation:none}}</style><g><rect x="8" y="62" width="104" height="8" rx="3" fill="#FDE68A"></rect><g><line x1="30" y1="34" x2="30" y2="62" stroke="#94A3B8" stroke-width="1"></line><ellipse cx="30" cy="22" rx="10" ry="13" fill="#F472B6"></ellipse></g><g><line x1="60" y1="34" x2="60" y2="62" stroke="#94A3B8" stroke-width="1"></line><ellipse cx="60" cy="22" rx="10" ry="13" fill="#60A5FA"></ellipse></g><g><line x1="90" y1="34" x2="90" y2="62" stroke="#94A3B8" stroke-width="1"></line><ellipse cx="90" cy="22" rx="10" ry="13" fill="#34D399"></ellipse></g></g></svg></button><button type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls=":R1tp:" data-lab-fold-toggle="true" class="ms-auto inline-flex min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-lg px-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-100 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-500"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye-off" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9.88 9.88a3 3 0 1 0 4.24 4.24"></path><path d="M10.73 5.08A10.43 10.43 0 0 1 12 5c7 0 10 7 10 7a13.16 13.16 0 0 1-1.67 2.68"></path><path d="M6.61 6.61A13.526 13.526 0 0 0 2 12s3 7 10 7a9.74 9.74 0 0 0 5.39-1.61"></path><line x1="2" x2="22" y1="2" y2="22"></line></svg><span>إخفاء</span></button></header><div id=":R1tp:" class="px-3 pb-3"><p class="leading-snug text-slate-800 text-sm"><span>قبل رحلة القسم إلى حديقة التجارب بالحامة، وقد تعاهد التلاميذ على المحافظة على نظافتها، طلب مندوب القسم 10 علب عصير و 10 قطع حلوى متماثلة ودفع ⁦800 DA⁩. في طريق العودة بقيت 2 علب عصير و 3 قطع حلوى ثمنها معا ⁦210 DA⁩. ما هو سعر علبة عصير وسعر قطعة حلوى؟</span></p></div></section></div><p class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 px-2 py-0.5 text-slate-800 text-sm" data-sm-named="true"><span class="font-bold text-indigo-900">المجهولان:</span><span><bdi dir="ltr" class="font-mono text-sm font-black" style="color:#2563EB">x</bdi> : <!-- -->سعر علبة العصير</span><span><bdi dir="ltr" class="font-mono text-sm font-black" style="color:#E11D48">y</bdi> : <!-- -->سعر قطعة الحلوى</span></p><div class="space-y-2" data-sm-core="true"><div class="space-y-1 rounded-2xl border-2 p-1.5 border-slate-200 bg-white" data-sm-row="1"><p class="line-clamp-2 text-sm" title="طلب مندوب القسم 10 علب عصير و 10 قطع حلوى متماثلة ودفع 800 DA"><span class="font-bold text-slate-600 inline">المعلومة 1<!-- --> : </span><span class="font-bold text-slate-900">«<!-- -->طلب مندوب القسم 10 علب عصير و 10 قطع حلوى متماثلة ودفع ⁦800 DA⁩<!-- -->»</span></p><div dir="ltr" class="flex flex-nowrap items-center justify-center font-mono font-extrabold text-slate-700 gap-1.5 text-xl"><div role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="المعادلة 1، معامل x: فارغة" data-drop-zone="slot:1:a" data-drop-owner=":R0:" class="relative rounded-2xl border-2 transition-colors min-h-[46px] border-dashed border-slate-300 bg-white/70  min-w-[3.5rem] "><span class="flex h-full min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center px-1.5"><span class="text-base text-slate-300">□</span></span></div><span style="color:#2563EB">x</span><span aria-hidden="true">+<